# PEXTRB/PEXTRD/PEXTRQ—Extract Byte/Dword/Qword -- override
# S-7: pdftotext runs the rows of PEXTRQ and VPEXTRB into one: the legacy forms' rows each its own, the VEX and EVEX
# forms left out.
@opcodes
66 0F 3A 14 /r ib | PEXTRB reg/m8, xmm2, imm8 | A | Valid | Valid | SSE4_1 | Extract a byte integer value from xmm2 at the source byte offset specified by imm8 into reg or m8.
66 0F 3A 16 /r ib | PEXTRD r/m32, xmm2, imm8 | A | Valid | Valid | SSE4_1 | Extract a dword integer value from xmm2 at the source dword offset specified by imm8 into r/m32.
66 REX.W 0F 3A 16 /r ib | PEXTRQ r/m64, xmm2, imm8 | A | Valid | N.E. | SSE4_1 | Extract a qword integer value from xmm2 at the source qword offset specified by imm8 into r/m64.
